 VERSION            250513

 RELEASE DATE       2025/05/13
 DESCRIPTION        range, time & pressure biases to be applied to SLR tracking
                    data and periods to be excluded from data analysis.

 INPUT              Corrections to SLR tracking data collected from various
                    tables at CDDIS, resolutions from the ILRS/ASC (AWG), the
                    T2L2 @ Jason-2 project (July 2008 to December 2017),
                    the final results of the ILRS Station Systematic Error
                    Monitoring--SSEM project amended with results from the
                    2024 extended version SSEM-X.

